<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87867" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόκροσσοι</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αι</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οι,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a, ranged in rows</i> or
				<i>ranks,</i> of ships on a narrow beach, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.35
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόκροσσαι ὅρμεον τὸ ἐς πόντον καὶ
					ἐπὶ ὀκτὼ νέας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.188
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέριξ αὐτὸ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χαλκήϊον</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> γρυπῶν κεφαλαὶ πρόκροσσοί εἰσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.152
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδέσεις οὐ περιφερεῖς, ἀλλὰ
				πρόκροσσαι</span> not round, but <i>ranged in ranks,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Democr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Sens.</u>
				79
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.606
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόκροσσοι φερόμενοι ἐπὶ
				τὸν κίνδυνον</span> rushing <i>in serried ranks</i> into
			danger, <i><span class="en">
				Agathocl.
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later in
			sg., <i>fringed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. περίβλημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					7.52
				</span></i>
			.</div>
